    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-granularity",
        "moduleId": "granularity-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "封锁的粒度",
        "markdown": "封锁对象的大小称为封锁粒度（granularity）。封锁的对象可以是逻辑单元，也可以是物理单元。以关系数据库为例，封锁对象可以是这样一些逻辑单元：属性值、属性值的集合、元组、关系、索引项、整个索引、整个数据库等；也可以是这样一些物理单元：页（数据页或索引页）、块等。封锁粒度与系统的并发度和并发控制的开销密切相关。封锁粒度越大，数据库所能够封锁的数据单元就越少，并发度就越小，系统开销也越小；封锁粒度越小，并发度较高，但系统开销也越大。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000671"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库恢复技术",
                "封锁的粒度"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11020,
              "lineEnd": 11029,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "c2c0894f8bdefbdb520a985d62fa13c10c6ddbf4a01574cbcd93ad7a55a866c9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "md-granularity-compare",
        "moduleId": "granularity-concept",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "封锁粒度权衡",
        "markdown": "| 粒度 | 示例 | 并发度 | 开销 | 适用场景 |\n|------|------|--------|------|---------|\n| 粗粒度 | 整个数据库 | 低 | 小 | 批量导入、全库备份 |\n| 中粒度 | 表 | 中 | 中 | 大部分 OLTP 操作 |\n| 细粒度 | 行、元组 | 高 | 大 | 高并发短事务 |\n\n实际数据库系统通常采用多粒度封锁，根据操作范围动态选择封锁粒度。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-granularity"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-multi-granularity",
        "moduleId": "multi-granularity",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "多粒度封锁",
        "markdown": "多粒度封锁（multiple granularity locking）是指在一个系统中同时支持多种封锁粒度供不同的事务选择。多粒度封锁方法允许事务根据需要选择封锁粒度：需要处理大量元组的事务可以选择以关系为封锁粒度；需要处理少量元组的事务可以选择以元组为封锁粒度。为了实现多粒度封锁，系统需要一种机制来检查封锁的相容性，这就是意向锁。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000672"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库恢复技术",
                "多粒度封锁"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11030,
              "lineEnd": 11048,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0004/images/bd26fc5baa00770b37c8b7814c5112b7ba33af874ad5c0a98f548035a76325b7.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "4e2b2e7f0addd33759bbd0be3dc4f626d7fa5db7508bec2d5b0026f64a968b3d"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-intention-lock",
        "moduleId": "multi-granularity",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "意向锁",
        "markdown": "意向锁（intention lock）是指如果对一个结点加意向锁，则说明该结点的下层结点正在被加锁；对任一结点加锁时，必须先对它的上层结点加意向锁。意向锁有多种类型：意向共享锁（Intent Share Lock，简称 IS 锁）、意向排他锁（Intent Exclusive Lock，简称 IX 锁）和共享意向排他锁（Share Intent Exclusive Lock，简称 SIX 锁）。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000673"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库恢复技术",
                "意向锁"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11049,
              "lineEnd": 11056,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "d6558034fd7ea1f293c56690ee184a7e1351ba36cf9f4f39d6ec376006c33e1b"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-is-lock",
        "moduleId": "multi-granularity",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "IS 锁",
        "markdown": "如果对一个数据对象加 IS 锁，表示它的后裔结点拟（意向）加 S 锁。例如，要对某个元组加 S 锁，则要首先对关系和数据库加 IS 锁。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000674"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库恢复技术",
                "IS锁"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11057,
              "lineEnd": 11062,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "bb098aad8a4f49ac310aafd3ffb3d8edf7eaa39d2cb43c64c316648e294ddc67"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-ix-lock",
        "moduleId": "multi-granularity",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "IX 锁",
        "markdown": "如果对一个数据对象加 IX 锁，表示它的后裔结点拟（意向）加 X 锁。例如，要对某个元组加 X 锁，则要首先对关系和数据库加 IX 锁。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000675"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库恢复技术",
                "IX 锁"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11063,
              "lineEnd": 11066,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "b414522e18a68f07f86e1883089f7e0d7033d85485c4cd863d5d792ab4a6a539"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-six-lock",
        "moduleId": "multi-granularity",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "SIX 锁",
        "markdown": "如果对一个数据对象加 SIX 锁，表示对它加 S 锁，再加 IX 锁，即 SIX = S + IX。例如，对某个表加 SIX 锁，则表示该事务要读整个表（所以要对该表加 S 锁），同时会更新部分元组（所以要对该表加 IX 锁）。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000676"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
